        243,
        1000,
        1447,
        1149
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a71. Establishment of the Mayoral Advisory Commission on City Art, Monuments, and Markers. There is hereby established under the direction of the Office of the Mayor an Advisory Commission on City Art, Monuments, and Markers (hereinafter the \"Commission\").",
