        1437,
        1422
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(a) The Commission shall consist of two Co-Chairs and no fewer than 10 members with widely recognized expertise in relevant disciplines, and officials from relevant City agencies who will provide technical expertise and guidance, all of whom shall be appointed by the Mayor and serve at the pleasure of the Mayor. Such City officials may designate employees of their agencies to serve in their place as appropriate.",
